  "description": "Avalonia display and shape-editing controls for the CvInspect machine-vision toolkit — Mat image display with zoom/pan/pixel probe, renderer-neutral overlay drawing, and draggable teaching shapes that write back to tool option POCOs. For Windows and Linux, checked by a headless test suite in CI on both and in one consumer's real window on Windows (no Linux desktop run yet; macOS is not verified). Based on OpenCvSharp; the native OpenCV runtime is chosen by the consumer.",
